[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u5143\u6975\u591C\u306E\u932C\u91D1\u515A\u306E\u4E00\u54E1\u3001\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC\u2026\u2026\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Walther, a former member of the Polar Night Alchemists...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u305D\u306E\u7814\u7A76\u8005\u3068\u3057\u3066\u306E\u8155\u3092\u8CB7\u308F\u308C\u3001\n\u3000\u738B\u56FD\u306B\u5229\u306E\u3042\u308B\u7814\u7A76\u306E\u305F\u3081\u3067\u3042\u308C\u3070\u4E00\u5B9A\u306E\n\u3000\u76E3\u8996\u4E0B\u306B\u304A\u3044\u3066\u884C\u52D5\u3092\u8A31\u3055\u308C\u3066\u3044\u308B\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(His research skills were valued enough that he\u0027s been granted some freedom to conduct studies beneficial to the kingdom, albeit under supervision.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u305D\u306E\u76E3\u8996\u5F79\u306E\u4F9D\u983C\u304C\u4FFA\u306E\u3082\u3068\u306B\u3082\n\u3000\u821E\u3044\u8FBC\u3093\u3067\u304D\u305F\u3002\n\u3000\u6700\u521D\u306F\u65AD\u308D\u3046\u304B\u3068\u601D\u3063\u305F\u304C\u2026\u2026\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(That supervision request came to me too. At first I thought about declining, but...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3042\u306E\u9802\u7363\u30A6\u30A7\u30EB\u30C6\u30C3\u30AF\u30B9\u3092\u7D20\u6750\u306B\n\u3000\u4EBA\u9020\u9802\u7363\u3092\u751F\u307F\u51FA\u3057\u305F\u4EBA\u7269\u3060\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(He\u0027s the one who created artificial Apex Beasts using Weltex as material.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u305D\u3070\u306B\u3044\u308C\u3070\u3001\u4FFA\u304C\u8ABF\u3079\u3066\u3044\u308B\n\u3000\u9802\u7363\u305D\u306E\u3082\u306E\u306B\u3064\u3044\u3066\u3082\u3088\u308A\u7406\u89E3\u304C\n\u3000\u6DF1\u307E\u308B\u304B\u3082\u3057\u308C\u306A\u3044\u2026\u2026\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Being close to him might help deepen my understanding of the Apex Beasts themselves...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u305D\u3046\u601D\u3044\u3001\u76E3\u8996\u5F79\u3092\u5F15\u304D\u53D7\u3051\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306B\n\u3000\u3057\u305F\u3002\u305D\u308D\u305D\u308D\u624B\u7D9A\u304D\u304C\u7D42\u308F\u3063\u3066\n\u3000\u57CE\u304B\u3089\u51FA\u3066\u304F\u308B\u306F\u305A\u3060\u304C\u2026\u2026\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(That\u0027s why I decided to take on the supervision role. The paperwork should be done, and he should be coming out of the castle soon...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u304A\u3084\u3002\u63A8\u5BDF\u3059\u308B\u306B\u3001\u3042\u306A\u305F\u304C\u4ECA\u65E5\u306E\n\u76E3\u8996\u5F79\u3001\u3067\u3059\u304B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Oh? I presume you\u0027re today\u0027s supervisor?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3055\u3066\u2026\u2026\u76F8\u624B\u306F\u8981\u6CE8\u610F\u4EBA\u7269\u3060\u3002\n\u3000\u3069\u3053\u307E\u3067\u81EA\u5206\u306E\u7D20\u6027\u3092\u660E\u304B\u3057\u305F\u3082\u306E\u304B\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Now then... he\u0027s a person of interest. How much should I reveal about myself?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u540D\u4E57\u308B\u3060\u3051\u306B\u7559\u3081\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just introduce myself"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4FFA\u306F\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC\u3060\u3002\u3088\u308D\u3057\u304F\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m Logy. Nice to meet you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u306F\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC\u3068\u7533\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002\n\u4EE5\u5F8C\u304A\u898B\u77E5\u308A\u304A\u304D\u3092",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I am Walther. A pleasure to make your acquaintance."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3068\u3053\u308D\u3067\u3001\u305D\u306E\u304A\u540D\u524D\u2026\u2026\n\u3082\u3057\u304B\u3057\u3066\u7570\u90A6\u4EBA\u306E\u65B9\u3067\u306F\u306A\u3044\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "By the way, that name... Could you perhaps be an Outlander?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF01\u3000\u3042\u3042\u3001\u305D\u3046\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "! Yes, that\u0027s right."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u77E5\u3063\u3066\u3044\u305F\u306E\u304B\u2026\u2026\u6CB9\u65AD\u306A\u3089\u306A\u3044\u306A\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(He knew... I can\u0027t let my guard down.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u76E3\u8996\u5F79\u3067\u3042\u308B\u3068\u80AF\u5B9A\u3059\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Confirm being the supervisor"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3060\u3002\u304A\u524D\u306E\u76E3\u8996\u5F79\u3092\u4EFB\u3055\u308C\u3066\u3044\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s right. I\u0027ve been assigned to supervise you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3054\u5B58\u3058\u304B\u3068\u306F\u601D\u3044\u307E\u3059\u304C\u3001\n\u79C1\u306F\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC\u30FB\u30DE\u30F3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Though you may already know, I am Walther Mann."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3068\u3053\u308D\u3067\u2026\u2026\u305D\u306E\u51FA\u3067\u7ACB\u3061\u3002\n\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u306F\u304A\u3084\u3081\u306B\u306A\u3063\u305F\u306E\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F\n\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC\u6BBF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "By the way... that attire. Have you ceased being an alchemist, Sir Logy?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF01\u3000\u4FFA\u306E\u3053\u3068\u3092\u77E5\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u304B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "! You know about me?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306F\u3044\u3002\u7570\u90A6\u4EBA\u306E\u60C5\u5831\u306F\u3042\u308B\u7A0B\u5EA6\u805E\u304D\u53CA\u3093\u3067\n\u3044\u307E\u3059\u306E\u3067\u3001\u3082\u3057\u304B\u3057\u3066\u3001\u3068",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. I\u0027ve heard a fair bit about the Outlanders, so I had my suspicions."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u7814\u7A76\u8005\u306A\u3060\u3051\u3042\u308B\u3002\u60C5\u5831\u96C6\u3081\u3068\u63A8\u6E2C\u306F\n\u3000\u304A\u624B\u306E\u7269\u3068\u3044\u3046\u308F\u3051\u304B\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(As expected of a researcher. Information gathering and deduction seem to be his forte.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7570\u90A6\u4EBA\u3067\u3042\u308B\u3053\u3068\u307E\u3067\u660E\u304B\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Reveal being an Outlander"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4FFA\u306F\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC\u3002\u5225\u306E\u4E16\u754C\u304B\u3089\u6765\u305F\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u3060\u3002\n\u7570\u90A6\u4EBA\u306A\u3093\u3066\u547C\u3070\u308C\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m Logy. An alchemist from another world. They call us Outlanders here."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u306F\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC\u30FB\u30DE\u30F3\u3002\n\u3053\u306E\u4E16\u754C\u306E\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I am Walther Mann. An alchemist of this world."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306E\u304A\u5642\u306F\u304B\u306D\u304C\u306D\u3002\n\u304A\u4F1A\u3044\u3067\u304D\u3066\u5149\u6804\u3067\u3059\u3001\u3075\u3075\u3075",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027ve heard much about you. It\u0027s an honor to meet you, hehehe."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u2026\u2026\u3053\u306E\u69D8\u5B50\u3001\u4E00\u76EE\u898B\u305F\u6642\u304B\u3089\n\u3000\u4FFA\u306E\u3053\u3068\u306F\u5206\u304B\u3063\u3066\u3044\u305F\u3093\u3060\u308D\u3046\u3002\n\u3000\u6CB9\u65AD\u306F\u7981\u7269\u3060\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(... From his behavior, he probably knew who I was from the moment he saw me. I need to be careful.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u6539\u3081\u3066\u3060\u304C\u3001\u4FFA\u306F\u4ECA\u738B\u56FD\u9A0E\u58EB\u306B\u5354\u529B\u3092\n\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3002\u3053\u306E\u51FA\u3067\u7ACB\u3061\u306F\u305D\u306E\u8A3C\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "To be clear, I\u0027m currently cooperating with the Kingdom Knights. This attire is proof of that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4FFA\u304C\u304A\u524D\u306E\u76E3\u8996\u3092\u3059\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306B\u306A\u3063\u305F\u306E\u3082\n\u305D\u306E\u5EF6\u9577\u7DDA\u4E0A\u3060\u304C\u3001\u5F15\u304D\u53D7\u3051\u305F\u4EE5\u4E0A\n\u624B\u3092\u629C\u304F\u3064\u3082\u308A\u306F\u306A\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My supervision of you is an extension of that, but now that I\u0027ve accepted, I won\u0027t slack off."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3082\u7814\u7A76\u304C\u3067\u304D\u306A\u3044\u306E\u306F\u56F0\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002\n\u9006\u3089\u3046\u3053\u3068\u306F\u3057\u307E\u305B\u3093",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It would be troublesome if I couldn\u0027t conduct my research. I won\u0027t resist."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3057\u304B\u3057\u3001\u3069\u3093\u306A\u65B9\u306B\u76E3\u8996\u3092\u3055\u308C\u308B\u306E\u304B\u3068\n\u601D\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F\u304C\u3001\u7570\u90A6\u4EBA\u306E\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u306E\u65B9\u3068\u306F\u3002\n\u79C1\u306F\u306A\u3093\u3066\u30C4\u30A4\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Though I wondered who would be supervising me, to think it would be an Outlander alchemist! How fortunate I am!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305C\u3072\u8272\u3005\u3054\u6559\u6388\u3044\u305F\u3060\u304D\u305F\u3044\u3082\u306E\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306E\u4E16\u754C\u3067\u306F\u3069\u306E\u3088\u3046\u306A\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u304C\n\u6271\u308F\u308C\u3066\u3044\u305F\u306E\u304B\u3092",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I would love to learn from you. About what kind of alchemy was practiced in your world..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4ECA\u65E5\u306F\u907A\u8DE1\u306E\u8ABF\u67FB\u3092\u884C\u3046\u3068\u805E\u3044\u3066\u3044\u308B\u304C\u3001\n\u305D\u308C\u306F\u5FC5\u8981\u306A\u3053\u3068\u306A\u306E\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I heard you\u0027re investigating ruins today. Is that really necessary?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u3063\u3068\u3001\u5931\u793C\u3002\u3067\u306F\u307E\u305F\u5F8C\u65E5\u304A\u4F3A\u3044\u3059\u308B\u3068\n\u3057\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, pardon me. I\u0027ll ask about that another time."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u3067\u3044\u3044\u3002\n\u4FFA\u3082\u3042\u307E\u308A\u3046\u308B\u3055\u304F\u8A00\u3046\u3064\u3082\u308A\u306F\u306A\u3044\u3093\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s better. I don\u0027t intend to be too strict anyway."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u3067\u306F\u3055\u3063\u305D\u304F\u3001\u907A\u8DE1\u3078\u5411\u304B\u3044\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well then, shall we head to the ruins?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u3053\u306E\u90E8\u5C4B\u304C\u8CAF\u8535\u5EAB\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3068\u3059\u308B\u3068\u3001\n\u3053\u306E\u6A5F\u69CB\u306F\u9577\u671F\u4FDD\u5B58\u3092\u884C\u3046\u305F\u3081\u306E\u3082\u306E\u3002\n\u3068\u306A\u308B\u3068\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...If this room was a storehouse, then this mechanism must have been for long-term preservation. Which means..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u2026\u2026\u3082\u3046\u6570\u6642\u9593\u305A\u3063\u3068\u3042\u306E\u8ABF\u5B50\u3067\n\u3000\u8ABF\u67FB\u3092\u7D9A\u3051\u3066\u3044\u308B\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(...He\u0027s been investigating like this for hours now.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u6839\u3063\u304B\u3089\u306E\u7814\u7A76\u8005\u3068\u3044\u3046\u306E\u306F\n\u3000\u672C\u5F53\u306E\u3088\u3046\u3060\u306A\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Seems he really is a dedicated researcher through and through.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3057\u304B\u3057\u3001\u3053\u306E\u307E\u307E\u3060\u3068\u4F11\u61A9\u3082\u98DF\u4E8B\u3082\n\u3000\u3068\u3089\u305A\u306B\u8ABF\u67FB\u3092\u7D9A\u3051\u305D\u3046\u3060\u3002\n\u3000\u4E00\u5FDC\u58F0\u3092\u304B\u3051\u3066\u304A\u304F\u304B\u2026\u2026\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(But at this rate, he\u0027ll keep investigating without taking breaks or meals. Maybe I should say something...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u3044\u3002\u968F\u5206\u7814\u7A76\u71B1\u5FC3\u306A\u3088\u3046\u3060\u304C\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey. You seem quite passionate about your research, but..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\u666E\u6BB5\u304B\u3089\u98EF\u306F\u305F\u3079\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Do you eat properly?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\u666E\u6BB5\u304B\u3089\u98EF\u306F\u305F\u3079\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Do you make sure to eat properly?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3061\u308D\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3002\u98DF\u4E8B\u306F\u4EBA\u9593\u306E\u8CC7\u672C\u3092\n\u5F62\u6210\u3057\u307E\u3059\u304B\u3089\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course. Food is vital for maintaining human capital."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306B\u3001\u98DF\u4E8B\u306E\u6804\u990A\u3092\u8003\u3048\u3066\u732E\u7ACB\u3092\n\u7D44\u3080\u306E\u306F\u3001\u306A\u304B\u306A\u304B\u9762\u767D\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3088\u3002\n\u7D44\u307F\u5408\u308F\u305B\u306F\u7121\u9650\u5927\u3067\u3059\u304B\u3089",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Besides, planning meals with proper nutrition is quite interesting. The combinations are endless!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u610F\u5916\u3060\u306A\u3002\u5FC5\u8981\u306A\u6804\u990A\u3055\u3048\u53D6\u308C\u308C\u3070\u3044\u3044\u3068\n\u8003\u3048\u3066\u3044\u308B\u304B\u3068\u601D\u3063\u3066\u3044\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s unexpected. I thought you\u0027d only care about getting the necessary nutrients."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\u5BDD\u3066\u3044\u308B\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you sleeping enough?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\u591C\u306F\u5BDD\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3093\u3060\u308D\u3046\u306A\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you getting proper sleep at night?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5B9A\u671F\u7684\u306B\u7761\u7720\u306F\u3068\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3088\u3002\n\u3057\u3063\u304B\u308A\u7720\u3089\u306A\u3044\u3068\u3001\u7814\u7A76\u52B9\u7387\u304C\n\u4E0B\u304C\u3063\u3066\u3057\u307E\u3044\u307E\u3059\u304B\u3089\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I do get regular sleep. After all, research efficiency drops without proper rest."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u3042\u3042\u3001\u3053\u306E\u76EE\u306E\u30AF\u30DE\u306F\u6C17\u306B\u3057\u306A\u3044\u3067\n\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002\u6642\u306B\u306F\u7761\u7720\u3088\u308A\u3082\u512A\u5148\u3059\u3079\u304D\n\u5927\u5207\u306A\u3053\u3068\u3082\u3042\u308B\u306E\u3067\u3059\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Ah, please don\u0027t mind these dark circles. Sometimes there are things more important than sleep."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u304B\u2026\u2026\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\u4F11\u606F\u3082\u8003\u3048\u3089\u308C\u3066\u3044\u308B\n\u306A\u3089\u3044\u3044\u3093\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see... As long as you\u0027re considering rest properly."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u90E8\u5C4B\u306F\u7247\u4ED8\u3044\u3066\u3044\u308B\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is your room tidy?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u90E8\u5C4B\u306F\u7247\u4ED8\u3044\u3066\u3044\u308B\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is your room kept tidy?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 52,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3048\u3002\u3082\u3061\u308D\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3002\u90E8\u5C4B\u304C\u8352\u308C\u3066\u3044\u3066\u306F\u3001\n\u601D\u8003\u3082\u6574\u3044\u307E\u305B\u3093\u304B\u3089\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, of course. A cluttered room leads to cluttered thoughts."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 53,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306B\u3001\u79C1\u306F\u7814\u7A76\u306E\u305F\u3081\u306B\u5404\u5730\u3092\u8EE2\u3005\u3068\n\u3059\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3082\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u304B\u3089\u3002\u5927\u5207\u306A\u3082\u306E\u306F\n\u3059\u3050\u6301\u3061\u51FA\u305B\u308B\u3088\u3046\u5E38\u306B\u6574\u7406\u3057\u3066\u307E\u3059\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Besides, I often travel for research, so I keep important things organized for quick access."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 54,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u308B\u307B\u3069\u3002\u81EA\u5206\u3060\u3051\u304C\u5206\u304B\u308C\u3070\u3044\u3044\u3001\n\u3068\u3044\u3046\u5974\u3082\u3044\u308B\u304B\u3089\u306A\u3002\n\u3057\u3063\u304B\u308A\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3088\u3046\u3067\u4F55\u3088\u308A\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see. Some people only care if they can understand their own mess. Good to hear you\u0027re thorough."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 55,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3057\u3084\u3001\u79C1\u304C\u7814\u7A76\u71B1\u5FC3\u3067\u79C1\u751F\u6D3B\u3092\u304A\u308D\u305D\u304B\u306B\n\u3059\u308B\u4EBA\u9593\u306B\u898B\u3048\u307E\u3057\u305F\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Did I perhaps come across as someone who neglects daily life in pursuit of research?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 56,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307E\u3042\u3001\u306A\u3002\u4E0D\u5FEB\u306B\u601D\u3063\u305F\u3089\u3001\u60AA\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, yes. Sorry if that offended you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 57,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3048\u3001\u305D\u3046\u601D\u308F\u308C\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306B\u306F\n\u6163\u308C\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3057\u3001\u5B9F\u969B\u305D\u3046\u3067\u3057\u305F\u304B\u3089\u306D\u3002\n\u4ECA\u306F\u5BDD\u98DF\u3069\u3061\u3089\u3082\u3057\u3063\u304B\u308A\u3068\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, I\u0027m used to that impression, and it was true in the past. But now I properly maintain both sleep and diet."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 58,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u98DF\u3079\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B\u306A\u3063\u305F\u304D\u3063\u304B\u3051\u306F\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What made you start eating properly?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 59,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4F55\u304B\u98DF\u3079\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B\u306A\u3063\u305F\n\u304D\u3063\u304B\u3051\u304C\u3042\u308B\u306E\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Was there something that made you start eating properly?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 60,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3048\u3002\u5B66\u751F\u6642\u4EE3\u3001\u7814\u7A76\u306B\u6CA1\u982D\u3057\u3066\n\u98DF\u4E8B\u3092\u6020\u308A\u5012\u308C\u305F\u969B\u3001\u30AF\u30EA\u30BB\u30EB\u30C0\u306B\n\u305D\u308C\u306F\u305D\u308C\u306F\u53F1\u3089\u308C\u307E\u3057\u3066\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. During my student days, I collapsed from neglecting meals while absorbed in research. Criselda gave me quite the scolding."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 61,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u4EE5\u6765\u3001\u98DF\u4E8B\u306F\u6804\u990A\u3082\u8003\u3048\u3066\n\u5B9A\u671F\u7684\u306B\u3068\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Since then, I\u0027ve made sure to eat regular, nutritious meals."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 62,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5BDD\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B\u306A\u3063\u305F\u304D\u3063\u304B\u3051\u306F\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What made you start sleeping properly?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 63,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4F55\u304B\u5BDD\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B\u306A\u3063\u305F\u304D\u3063\u304B\u3051\u304C\u3042\u308B\u306E\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Was there something that made you start sleeping properly?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 64,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3048\u3002\u79C1\u306F\u3053\u306E\u30AF\u30DE\u306E\u305B\u3044\u3082\u3042\u3063\u3066\u3001\n\u6614\u304B\u3089\u30AF\u30EA\u30BB\u30EB\u30C0\u306B\u306F\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\u5BDD\u308D\u3068\n\u8A00\u308F\u308C\u7D9A\u3051\u3066\u307E\u3057\u3066\u306D\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. Because of these dark circles, Criselda has always been telling me to get proper sleep..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 65,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u3082\u3042\u3063\u3066\u3001\u6642\u3005\u306F\u5BDD\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B\n\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3088\u3002\u7656\u306B\u306A\u3063\u305F\u306E\u304B\u3001\n\u306A\u304B\u306A\u304B\u30AF\u30DE\u306F\u53D6\u308C\u307E\u305B\u3093\u304C",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s why I started sleeping occasionally. Though it\u0027s become a habit, the dark circles won\u0027t seem to go away."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 66,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u6163\u308C\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3068\u3044\u3046\u306E\u306F\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What do you mean by \u0027used to it\u0027?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 67,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u601D\u308F\u308C\u308B\u306E\u306B\u306F\u6163\u308C\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3001\n\u3068\u3044\u3046\u306E\u306F\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What do you mean you\u0027re \u0027used to that impression\u0027?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 68,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5B66\u751F\u6642\u4EE3\u3001\u591A\u304F\u306E\u540C\u7D1A\u751F\u3084\u6559\u5E2B\u305F\u3061\u304B\u3089\n\u540C\u3058\u3088\u3046\u306A\u3053\u3068\u3092\u8A00\u308F\u308C\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "During my student days, many classmates and teachers said similar things."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 69,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7814\u7A76\u306E\u5DEE\u3057\u5165\u308C\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3001\u3088\u304F\u98DF\u3079\u7269\u3082\n\u8CB0\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3057\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They would often bring me food as research provisions..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 70,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u308B\u6642\u3001\u5148\u8F29\u306B\u6CE8\u610F\u3055\u308C\u3066\u304B\u3089\u306F\n\u6C17\u3092\u4ED8\u3051\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u304C",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "After being warned by a senior, I started being more careful."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 71,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7D50\u679C\u3001\u4F53\u529B\u304C\u3064\u304D\u3001\u3088\u308A\u9577\u304F\u7814\u7A76\u304C\n\u3067\u304D\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "As a result, I gained more stamina and could research for longer periods."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 72,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC\u6BBF\u3082\u3044\u304B\u304C\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\uFF1F\n\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306E\u60C5\u5831\u3092\u79C1\u306B\u63D0\u4F9B\u3057\u3066\u3044\u305F\u3060\u3051\u308C\u3070\u3001\n\u5B8C\u74A7\u306A\u751F\u6D3B\u8A08\u753B\u3092\u7ACB\u3066\u3066\u307F\u305B\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How about it, Sir Logy? If you share your information with me, I could devise a perfect lifestyle plan for you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 73,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3084\u3001\u9060\u616E\u3059\u308B\u3088\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No thanks, I\u0027ll pass..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 74,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u6B8B\u5FF5\u3067\u3059\u3002\u7570\u90A6\u4EBA\u306E\u8EAB\u4F53\u8A18\u9332\u3001\n\u3068\u3066\u3082\u8208\u5473\u6DF1\u3044\u306E\u3067\u3059\u304C\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How unfortunate. An Outlander\u0027s physical data would be so fascinating..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 75,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u932C\u91D1\u515A\u306E\u4E00\u4EBA\u3060\u3068\u805E\u3044\u3066\u3044\u305F\u306F\u305A\u3060\u304C\u2026\u2026\n\u3000\u3082\u3057\u304B\u3057\u3066\u305F\u3060\u306E\u7814\u7A76\u30D0\u30AB\u306A\u306E\u304B\uFF1F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I heard he was from the Alchemist Party, but... could he just be a research fanatic?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]